              },
              {
                "name": "timeout",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Request timeout in milliseconds"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Fetches a web page and converts it to clean, LLM-friendly markdown.\n\n**Options:**\n- `target_selector` — extract specific page sections\n- `remove_selector` — strip unwanted elements\n\nReturns 400 if the URL is invalid or unreachable."
